<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Reset Your Password</title>
</head>

<body style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: #333;">
    <h2>Hello {{name}},</h2>
    <p>You requested to reset your password for your StudyUpIndia account.</p>
    <p>
        Click the link below to reset your password. This link will expire in 1 hour:
    </p>
    <p>
        <a href="{{resetLink}}" style="color: #0a2d80;">{{resetLink}}</a>
    </p>
    <p>If you didn’t request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
    <br />
    <p>Thanks,<br />The StudyUpIndia Team</p>
</body>

</html>